{"resourceIdentifier":"3058","resourceName":"Jiayu MSW Landfill Site LFG Pollution Treatment and Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Jiayu MSW Landfill Site LFG Pollution Treatment and Comprehensive Utilization Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Jiayu County MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as Jiayu landfill site), in Danushan Village, Guanqiao Town, Jiayu County, Hubei Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Jiayu County BCCY New Energy Co., Ltd.\r\nJiayu landfill site started collecting and handling waste in 2014.\r\nThe project started to construct on 15/08/2021. The project has a total designed capacity 0.5MW (1*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 32,025MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 19,169tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 191,691tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.\r\nScenario existing prior to the implementation of the project (the same as baseline scenario):\r\nLFG from Jiayu landfill site is emitted to the atmosphere directly.\r\nEquivalent electricity generated by the project is supplied by the CCPG, which is dominated by fossil fuel based power plants.","location":{"latitude":29.827178,"longitude":113.895686},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-19","endExclusive":"2022-06-19","endInclusive":"2022-06-18"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3058"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"19168"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"23/01/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2022 - 31/12/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=66852&IDKEY=8kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909j92188908","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Jiayu-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-05-19T11:00:11.973Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=64288&IDKEY=8lksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku09888653152","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-Jiayu.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-04-01T09:45:24.81Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=106341&IDKEY=9iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfk146644239","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Jiayu-revised - Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-01-23T11:06:01.183Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.as